Jabeer Cambridge Study Companion — Free Cambridge Grade 8 Physics prototype

Files:
- index.html
- style.css
- app.js

Run locally:
1. Keep all three files in the same folder.
2. Open index.html in a browser.
3. No server or API key is required.

The site currently focuses on Physics and uses original practice questions. Progress is saved in browser localStorage.

